{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13102050","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13102050","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:3:1310205001:1":{"text":"斯瓦夫先生，又见到你啦！","source_cn":"斯瓦夫先生，又见到你啦！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x74868EC52EF85D6F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1310205002:1":{"text":"艾雅在上，是你们！真是巧了，我刚刚才进雪松镇，就又和你们碰面了！","source_cn":"艾雅在上，是你们！真是巧了，我刚刚才进雪松镇，就又和你...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA8A051A9E0776589","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1310205003:1":{"text":"那个很厉害的白狼……法拉莫尔呢？","source_cn":"那个很厉害的白狼……法拉莫尔呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x069887DF241D0681","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1310205004:1":{"text":"他还有工作要做，刚来雪松镇就和我们分开了。","source_cn":"他还有工作要做，刚来雪松镇就和我们分开了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C847F350A7A0BAF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1310205005:1":{"text":"我把那一家三口送上马车就往镇子里跑，饭也顾不上吃，还好没错过开幕式。","source_cn":"我把那一家三口送上马车就往镇子里跑，饭也顾不上吃，还好...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D6B889EBE117D9D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1310205006:1":{"text":"是了，说好了要给你们做向导，带你们逛逛……","source_cn":"是了，说好了要给你们做向导，带你们逛逛……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x57FE3BC1FBEE7E37","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:9:1310205006":{"text":"是了，说好了要给你们做向导，带你们逛逛……","source_cn":"是了，说好了要给你们做向导，带你们逛逛……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x57FE3BC1FBEE7E37","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1310205007:1":{"text":"对呀，你看起来风尘仆仆的，一定累坏了。","source_cn":"对呀，你看起来风尘仆仆的，一定累坏了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x345031D70D27307B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1310205008:1":{"text":"先吃点东西好好休息一下吧。","source_cn":"先吃点东西好好休息一下吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9327E1CDDA830E0A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1310205011:1":{"text":"哎呀，这……你们这么说了，我也就不和你们争了。","source_cn":"哎呀，这……你们这么说了，我也就不和你们争了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x39E4266FC3C276FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1310205012:1":{"text":"你们有需要就来找我，我就住那边的旅馆。喏，叫“雪与火”的那家就是。","source_cn":"你们有需要就来找我，我就住那边的旅馆。喏，叫“雪与火”...","status":"matched","hash_xx